  "assetBytes": 25699926,
  "notes": [
    "First-person assets represent the named physical weapon families. They are not exact official CS2 or VALORANT meshes.",
    "All six FP rigs include arms. They require the locally provided Three.js MeshoptDecoder plus WebP support; no Draco is needed.",
    "No aim/fire/reload gameplay animation clips are claimed from the FP files; grip_vgrip is only a pose clip.",
    "The six compressed FP rigs reference shared arms_basecolor.webp and arms_normal.webp beside the GLBs; these are shipped locally and image-verified."
  ],
